Matt 2:1 , The wise men from the east enquire after Christ;
Matt 2:3 , at which Herod is alarmed;
Matt 2:9 , They are directed by a star to Bethlehem, worship him, and offer their presents;
Matt 2:13 , Joseph flees into Egypt with Jesus and his mother;
Matt 2:16 , Herod slays the children;
Matt 2:20 , himself dies;
Matt 2:23 , Christ is brought back again into Galilee to Nazareth.
